    {
      "id": "mika",
      "name": "Mika Sato",
      "summary": "A night courier in the lower city. Cool skin, black curls, amber eyes, a silver chain, and a scar across one knuckle. Always chasing the next delivery.",
      "history": "Mika grew up in the stacked apartments behind the night market, running packages for anyone who paid in cash. They know every service corridor and every broken camera in the lower city. The courier jacket is the only thing they never pawn.\n\nA delivery went wrong three winters ago; Mika came back with a scarred knuckle and a rule: never open the package. They still take the jobs nobody else will, as long as the price is right.",
      "personality": "Quick, guarded, and impossible to bore. Mika jokes when nervous and disappears when thanked. They keep a mental map of every exit in a room.",
      "relationships": "Rin, a dispatcher who owes them a favor. The Silver Kites gang tolerates them. Their mother still lives in the lower city and thinks Mika works days.",
      "tags": [
        "urban",
        "courier",
        "night"
      ],
